"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq2^\\omega\">\\(C\\subseteq2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(C\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall Y\\in C\\ \\operatorname{MLRandom}(Y)\">\\(\\forall Y\\in C\\ \\operatorname{MLRandom}(Y)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4da300de847d0dba\" href=\"?note=4da300de847d0dba\" title=\"20-cor-random-closed-class\">20-cor-random-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"aed1d844fad5cccf\" href=\"?note=aed1d844fad5cccf\" title=\"20-thm-superlow-basis\">20-thm-superlow-basis</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}low\\text{-}random}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in C\\ [\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\land \\operatorname{Superlow}(X)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}low\\text{-}random}\\vdash\n\\exists X\\in C\\ [\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\land \\operatorname{Superlow}(X)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>直接应用 superlow 基定理；superlow 蕴含 low。这里同一个见证兼有这两项性质。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 11.2.2 与 Theorem 9.4.2 的推论；印刷页 177, 191；PDF 第 209, 222 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-cor-random-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"4da300de847d0dba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-cor-random-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-superlow-basis","status":"resolved","id":"aed1d844fad5cccf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","lo